        SEG
        MOVE W I 6000, R0
        MOVE W I 45, !R0+
        MOVE W I 12, !R0+
        MOVE W I 87, !R0+
        MOVE W I 23, !R0+
        MOVE W I 56, !R0
        MOVE W I 6000, R0
        MOVE W I 5, R1
        MOVE W !R0, R2
        MOVE W I 1, R3
loop:   CMP W R3, R1
        JGE done
        MOVE W R0, R4
        MOVE W R3, R5
        MULT W I 4, R5
        ADD W R5, R4
        MOVE W !R4, R6
        CMP W R6, R2
        JLE skip
        MOVE W R6, R2
skip:   ADD W I 1, R3
        JUMP loop
done:   HALT
        END
